{"meta":{"templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"Send new token listing alerts from 10 crypto exchanges to Discord and Slack","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-60,-400],"parameters":{"color":1,"width":1000,"height":800,"content":"## Crypto exchange listing alerts for Discord, no account needed\n\nWatches 10 crypto exchanges and posts every new token listing to a Discord channel as a color-coded embed, with an optional Slack copy.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Every 5 minutes** starts the run.\n2. **Your settings** holds everything you might want to change: the Discord webhook, exchanges, spot or futures, a keyword filter, lookback window, headline language, and the Slack switch.\n3. **Fetch new listings** calls a free, public, read-only JSON feed. No account, no API key, no token.\n4. **Feed returned items?** ends an empty or failed run quietly instead of throwing.\n5. **Only listings not seen before** remembers each permalink across executions, so a restart never re-announces a listing.\n6. Two filters narrow the stream to the exchanges and keywords you care about.\n7. **Prepare alert fields** picks the headline in your language and builds the fields both channels reuse.\n8. Spot listings post as a green embed, futures listings as an orange one. Slack stays off until you enable it.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. In Discord open your channel settings, then Integrations, then Webhooks, and copy a webhook URL.\n2. Open **Your settings** and paste it into `discord_webhook_url`.\n3. Optional: set `send_to_slack` to `true` and paste a Slack incoming webhook URL into `slack_webhook_url`.\n4. Save, then activate the workflow. No n8n credential is required anywhere.\n\n### Customization tips\n\nNarrow the feed with `exchanges` (`binance,okx`) or `listing_type` (`spot` or `futures`). Raise `lookback_days` up to 30 to backfill on the first run. Titles arrive in three languages, so set `language` to `en`, `zh` or `ko`."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-60,420],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":820,"height":520,"content":"## 1. Poll the public feed\nA schedule trigger, your settings in one place, one HTTP request to a free read-only endpoint, and a guard so an empty response ends the run quietly. No credential is needed here."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[780,420],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":880,"height":520,"content":"## 2. One item per listing, new ones only\nSplit Out expands the array. Remove Duplicates stores every permalink already handled. The two filters keep only the exchanges and keywords you chose in settings."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1680,420],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":420,"height":660,"content":"## 3. Build the fields and pick a branch\nCompose the headline, symbols and link once, then decide where this listing goes. Spot and futures get different embed colors; Slack stays off until you enable it."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2120,420],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":440,"height":660,"content":"## 4. Deliver\nThree webhook posts, same fields. Discord gets an embed, Slack gets mrkdwn text. Swap any of them for Telegram, Gmail or a database without touching anything upstream."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010","name":"Every 5 minutes","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","notes":"How often to check the feed. Every 5 minutes is a good balance; the feed is cached for 5 minutes anyway.","position":[0,600],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"minutes","minutesInterval":5}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011","name":"Your settings","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","notes":"Everything you may want to change lives here. discord_webhook_url: a Discord channel webhook URL (required). exchanges: comma separated ids such as binance,okx (empty = all). listing_type: spot or futures (empty = both). keyword: only alert when the headline contains it (empty = no filter). lookback_days: 1 to 30. language: en, zh or ko. Leave send_to_slack as false until you paste a Slack incoming webhook URL.","position":[200,600],"parameters":{"mode":"manual","assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"discord_webhook_url","type":"string","value":"YOUR_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"exchanges","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"listing_type","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"keyword","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"lookback_days","type":"string","value":"1"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"language","type":"string","value":"en"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"send_to_slack","type":"string","value":"false"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","name":"slack_webhook_url","type":"string","value":""}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012","name":"Fetch new listings","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"A free, public, read-only JSON feed of new token listings across 10 exchanges. No account and no API key. Only days and type are sent as query parameters; the exchange list is applied by the filter node below. neverError is on so a bad response is handled by the next node instead of stopping the workflow.","position":[400,600],"parameters":{"url":"https://tokenearly.com/api/public/listings.json","options":{"response":{"response":{"neverError":true}}},"sendQuery":true,"queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"days","value":"={{ $json.lookback_days }}"},{"name":"type","value":"={{ $json.listing_type }}"},{"name":"limit","value":"100"}]}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013","name":"Feed returned items?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","notes":"Guard: the feed returns a count field, so an unreachable or empty response ends the run quietly instead of throwing further down.","position":[620,600],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":false,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","operator":{"type":"number","operation":"gt"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.count }}","rightValue":0}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014","name":"Nothing new this run","type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","notes":"Normal outcome most of the time. Nothing to do.","position":[620,780],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015","name":"Split into one item per listing","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitOut","notes":"The feed returns one object with an items array; this turns it into one n8n item per listing.","position":[840,600],"parameters":{"options":{},"fieldToSplitOut":"items"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016","name":"Only listings not seen before","type":"n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates","notes":"Remembers each listing's permalink across executions, so restarts and overlapping windows never re-announce a listing.","position":[1060,600],"parameters":{"logic":"removeItemsWithAlreadySeenKeyValues","options":{},"operation":"removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions","dedupeValue":"={{ $json.permalink }}"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017","name":"Matches your exchange filter?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","notes":"Passes everything when exchanges is empty in settings, because the left side then falls back to this listing's own exchange.","position":[1280,600],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":false,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"contains"},"leftValue":"={{ $('Your settings').first().json.exchanges || $json.exchange }}","rightValue":"={{ $json.exchange }}"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018","name":"Matches your keyword filter?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","notes":"Passes everything when keyword is empty in settings. Matching runs against all three language titles at once.","position":[1480,600],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":false,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"contains"},"leftValue":"={{ ($json.title.en || '') + ' ' + ($json.title.zh || '') + ' ' + ($json.title.ko || '') }}","rightValue":"={{ $('Your settings').first().json.keyword }}"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019","name":"Skipped by your filters","type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","notes":"Listings that did not match. Kept as a separate branch so you can see what was filtered out in the execution log.","position":[1480,780],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020","name":"Prepare alert fields","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","notes":"Picks the headline in the language you chose, joins the token symbols, works out how old the announcement is, and keeps the link, so the Discord and Slack nodes below only format.","position":[1720,600],"parameters":{"mode":"manual","assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890c","name":"headline","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.title[$('Your settings').first().json.language] || $json.title.en || $json.title.zh || $json.title.ko }}"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890d","name":"symbols_text","type":"string","value":"={{ ($json.symbols || []).join(', ') }}"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890e","name":"type_label","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.type === 'futures' ? 'Futures' : 'Spot' }}"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890f","name":"minutes_old","type":"string","value":"={{ Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - new Date($json.published_at).getTime()) / 60000)) }}"},{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890g","name":"link","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.source_url || $json.permalink }}"}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021","name":"Is it a futures listing?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","notes":"Spot and futures deserve different colours, so they take separate Discord branches.","position":[1920,600],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"futures"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022","name":"Also send to Slack?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","notes":"Optional. Off by default; set send_to_slack to true in Your settings to enable.","position":[1920,880],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"+1234567890+1234567890","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $('Your settings').first().json.send_to_slack }}","rightValue":"true"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000023","name":"Send futures alert to Discord","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"Posts an orange embed to the Discord webhook URL from Your settings. A webhook URL needs no n8n credential. Change the color number to restyle it.","position":[2200,600],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $('Your settings').first().json.discord_webhook_url }}","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ content: '⚡ New futures listing', embeds: [{ title: $json.exchange_name + ' · Futures listing', description: $json.headline, url: $json.source_url || $json.permalink, color: 15965202, fields: [ { name: 'Exchange', value: $json.exchange_name, inline: true }, { name: 'Symbols', value: $json.symbols_text || '-', inline: true }, { name: 'Published', value: $json.minutes_old + ' min ago', inline: true } ], footer: { text: 'Data by Tokenearly' }, timestamp: $json.published_at }] }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000024","name":"Send spot alert to Discord","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"Same webhook URL as the futures branch, green embed and different wording.","position":[2200,760],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $('Your settings').first().json.discord_webhook_url }}","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ content: '🔔 New spot listing', embeds: [{ title: $json.exchange_name + ' · Spot listing', description: $json.headline, url: $json.source_url || $json.permalink, color: 3066993, fields: [ { name: 'Exchange', value: $json.exchange_name, inline: true }, { name: 'Symbols', value: $json.symbols_text || '-', inline: true }, { name: 'Published', value: $json.minutes_old + ' min ago', inline: true } ], footer: { text: 'Data by Tokenearly' }, timestamp: $json.published_at }] }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000025","name":"Send to Slack","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"Paste a Slack incoming webhook URL into Your settings. The text uses Slack mrkdwn; spot and futures get different prefixes.","position":[2200,920],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $('Your settings').first().json.slack_webhook_url }}","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"text","value":"={{ $json.type === 'futures' ? ':zap: New futures listing' : ':bell: New spot listing' }}\n*{{ $json.exchange_name }}* · {{ $json.type_label }} listing\n{{ $json.headline }}\n{{ $json.symbols_text }}\n<{{ $json.link }}|Original announcement>"}]}},"typeVersion":4.2}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"Your settings":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch new listings","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Every 5 minutes":{"main":[[{"node":"Your settings","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch new listings":{"main":[[{"node":"Feed returned items?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Also send to Slack?":{"main":[[{"node":"Send to Slack","type":"main","index":0}],[]]},"Feed returned items?":{"main":[[{"node":"Split into one item per listing","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Nothing new this run","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Prepare alert fields":{"main":[[{"node":"Is it a futures listing?","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Also send to Slack?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Is it a futures listing?":{"main":[[{"node":"Send futures alert to Discord","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Send spot alert to Discord","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Matches your keyword filter?":{"main":[[{"node":"Prepare alert fields","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Skipped by your filters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Matches your exchange filter?":{"main":[[{"node":"Matches your keyword filter?","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Skipped by your filters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Only listings not seen before":{"main":[[{"node":"Matches your exchange filter?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Split into one item per listing":{"main":[[{"node":"Only listings not seen before","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}